# Player Turn: Vera Nighthollow — Vera casts Detect Magic on Father Vane and on the rune Emmett found on his skin. She is looking for the shape of whatever passed through him — not the man, but the door it used him as.
**Campaign:** Ravenmoor  **Session:** session8  **Scene:** scene1  **File:** turn_004.md  **Time:** 2026-04-24 03:26:53 UTC

## 🔍 What Happened
Characters:
- Sister Isolde Carrow - Fallen Cleric. Currently huddled around the campfire, clinging to her faith. She is a former healer of St. Aldric's order who lost her faith after failing to save a dying child. Her divine magic still works, which terrifies her.
- Dorian Ashgrove - Disgraced Investigator. He is currently studying a tattered parchment found on Father Vane, trying to decipher strange markings on it. He was dismissed from his position as a crown investigator for pursuing a case no one wanted solved (the Holloway disappearances, 1891).
- Emmett Grave - Graverobber turned Archaeologist. He is crouched over Father Vane's body, searching for any signs of the supernatural entity that vacated him. He knows twelve ways to open a locked crypt and has used all of them.
- Vera Nighthollow - Witch. She is currently casting Detect Magic on Father Vane and on the rune Emmett found on his skin. She lives on the edge of the law and the edge of the forest, speaking to animals and known for her knowledge of herbalism, folk magic, and things her grandmother told her never to repeat.

Recent Events: The party is huddled around their campfire in Ravenmoor when Father Vane convulsed and his eyes flashed open with a demonic intensity. The malevolent force within him was no longer hidden, causing the party to freeze in fear as he lunged at them.

Acting Character: Vera Nighthollow
Vera Nighthollow is a witch who lives on the edge of the law and the edge of the forest. She knows herbalism, folk magic, and things her grandmother told her never to repeat. Animals speak to her, but they don't like what they tell her, which makes her distrusted by respectable people. However, she is sought out when they are desperate.

Vera has the ability to cast Detect Magic at will. She also knows how to brew potions (1 hour, herbalism kit, DC 12 Arcana). Vera stands on the edge of society, often using her knowledge of magic and plants for her own purposes. In this situation, she is using her abilities to detect any magical presence

